{
 "doc": "M4-C16-02 greybox (tools/act1/ch15_16_greybox.py; do not edit by hand): the Drowned Choir at moonrise (colour script ch16). M4-A2P-106: the kit's amphitheatre: the dais, the flooded channel (bridged north and south), six tiers to the rim, the singers standing in the sea at r 44; the way in from the south (Approach) through the tiers' gap, the north aisle a ramp up to Kesh's place. Kesh's place at the ring's head (kesh), where Sefir comes (sefir), Kerrid's line behind Asha (kerrid_line). Sefir's Abiding guard and the storm waking early are fought here; the act ends on a Rhen voice-over. The story waits on the beat sheet (M4-C16-01).",
